# Frontend

- UI hiding is not RBAC. Assume the user curls the API.
- Judge console: 30 reviews in ~5 hours must not be miserable (keyboard, persist draft scores).
- Gallery search/filter is T1. Results stay hidden from non-organizers during the voting window.
- Call only the local API. No browser keys for cloud AI or S3.
- Embeddable widget (T4) is a separate public surface with a public token, not admin cookies.
